mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: x-growth\ndescription: >-\n  The X/Twitter growth playbook for 2026. Use when someone wants to \"grow on X / Twitter,\" \"get more\n  reach/followers/impressions on X,\" \"an X content/posting strategy,\" \"should I get X Premium,\" \"how\n  the X algorithm works,\" or how to use replies/quote-posts/long-form/video to grow. Conversation is\n  the engine (replies and first-hour velocity), Premium is effectively a baseline, and links go in the\n  first reply. Uses the SPARK framework. Reads brand-profile + voice-builder first. The agent drafts\n  posts + reply copy; a human does the live replying/quote-posts/community engagement; WoopSocial\n  schedules posts; metrics come from native X analytics; nothing is fabricated. Complements\n  thread-writer (thread-format craft).\nversion: 1.0.0\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
